primitives.doc:
Attentional focus on `target`: concentration and absorption in the target
(UWES absorption, Schaufeli et al. 2002; WOLF absorption, Bakker 2008;
inability to detach, Sonnentag & Fritz 2007).

constructs.doc:
Extrinsic effort: demands and obligations of the job, measured by the
ERI effort scale (time pressure, interruptions, responsibility, overload;
Siegrist 1996; Siegrist et al. 2004).

propositions.doc:
Effort-reward imbalance predicts strain and ill health (Siegrist 1996;
van Vegchel, de Jonge, Bosma & Schaufeli 2005, review of 45 studies;
Dragano et al. 2017, meta-analysis for coronary heart disease).

Lack of detachment predicts exhaustion over one year: detachment is
negatively related to exhaustion (Sonnentag, Binnewies & Mojza 2010;
Sonnentag & Fritz 2015 review).
